the asset replay double's connections alive at both ends\n\nThe offline Linear asset workspace answered every request `Connection: close`\nand forwarded each one over a fresh connection to the backend, so every\nrequest cost two loopback connections. This branch routes its standing-set\nreplay journeys through that double, in the same process as the rest of the\nLinear e2e suite, and the Windows check then failed `cache_budget` with\n`error sending request` against a loopback that was listening — the failure\nAGENTS.md attributes to loopback port pressure on that runner. Serve it with\n`loopback::serve_each` and forward through one `loopback::Upstream` per client\nconnection, as AGENTS.md prescribes; the credentialed live observer is\nunchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-10-30T02:11:52Z","author":{"name":"Nick DeRobertis","email":"19440155+nickderobertis@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"Nick DeRobertis","email":"19440155+nickderobertis@users.noreply.github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.